  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P112- Enhancing the safety and security of chemical facilities by building capacity in the North Africa and Sahel region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective is to improve best practice in chemical installations, to identify hazards and carry out risk assessments, to take preventive/protective measures and to help the competent authorities inspect these installations.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
